  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "<h4><strong>小空间里，餐厅如何让一家人共进晚餐？</strong></h4>\n<p>改造前：空间拥挤、餐桌坐不下全家人<br />解决方案：可伸缩餐桌，餐边储物柜</p>",
    "pub-text"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/17/14/17142aea21cd27f8d7c5a8e193dc526e.jpg",
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/e9/47/e947e252cb06df0df7af5d9abcd2a727.jpg",
